  "description": "Spacious, bright and just upgraded in 2020.  This two-bedroom apartment in the premium development of Carysfort Hall apartments is exceptionally large at 1047 sq.ft. / 97.30 sq.m. plus a private garage in the secure car park.  With a large living room overlooking the manicured grounds of Carysfort Hall, the complex is adjacent to Carysfort Park and Avoca Park, with a small river, the Maretimo, running through both.\nUCD Smurfit Business School is located across the Park, while Blackrock Village is c. 1KM along Carysfort Avenue towards the coast.  An abundance of amenities is in the Village, including several coffee shops (Bear Market, Coffee to Go, Insomnia, Vanilla Pod), numerous restaurants throughout the Village including Michelin-Starred Liath in Blackrock Market. \nTransport is well-serviced in the area with several bus routes going north & southbound, DART station and easy proximity to N11 and M50 at J14 Leopardstown. All appliances are installed, while the dining suite is also in place.",
